      "raw_text": "Filipinos flocked to Binondo in Manila on New Year’s Eve for their last-minute shopping, specifically to buy some lucky charms to welcome 2026 or the “Year of the Fire Horse.”\n\nAccording to JP Soriano’s report in “24 Oras” on Wednesday, lucky charms designed with horse figures are a hit with customers.\n\nRead more:\nhttps://t.co/nUovXWyhR8",
      "cleaned_text": "Filipinos flocked to Binondo in Manila on New Year’s Eve for their last-minute shopping, specifically to buy some lucky charms to welcome 2026 or the “Year of the Fire Horse.” According to JP Soriano’s report in “24 Oras” on Wednesday, lucky charms designed with horse figures are a hit with customers. Read more:",
      "english_translation": "Filipinos flocked to Binondo in Manila on New Year’s Eve for their last-minute shopping, specifically to buy some lucky charms to welcome 2026 or the “Year of the Fire Horse.” According to JP Soriano’s report in “24 Oras” on Wednesday, lucky charms designed with horse figures are a hit with customers. Read more:",
